  "resolution": "Explains is quality-indexed being-F explanation. ExplanationGrounds openly projects it onto directed Ground. ProducesChange is efficient origination, never inferred from Ground or explanatory predication. The grounding model tests only asymmetry and non-inherence; Aristotle’s further demand for an efficient source of change remains unanswered.",
